BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (to U.S. entities, with foreign firms receiving an NCAGE code instead, and says a valid CAGE or NCAGE is needed to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (finish SAM.gov registration and bid on contracts [rRWCLLWqrV0 @ 00:00:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The practitioners also agree on what not to chase. Eric Coffie is blunt that nobody needs a CAGE code before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (registering: once the entity information is submitted for processing, the government assigns the code and adds it to the) Tj ET
