BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.77 Tm (The most expensive trap the federal practitioners report is waiting for a certificate to deliver revenue. Rick Howard is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 366.55 Tm (blunt that contracts will not land in your lap after certification, even though the SDVOSB approval took about two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 351.32 Tm (weeks while 8\(a\) and WOSB can run far longer [Qij-5QQmwc8 @ 00:03:39]. GovKidMethod lands on the same point) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 336.10 Tm (from the SBA side: the SBA is not going to be bringing you contracts, which is why 8\(a\) should wait until real prime) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.87 Tm (past performance exists [xXM1cyLQ_jY @ 00:07:09]. Certification can also slip out from under a firm. HUBZone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 305.65 Tm (eligibility hangs on an employee-residency ratio, with 35% of employees required to live in a HUBZone per US) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 290.42 Tm (Federal Contractor Registration, so a firm that hires outside the zone can outgrow its own status [xXM1cyLQ_jY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 275.20 Tm (00:13:48]. A quieter trap is assuming a state badge travels: GovKidMethod warns that state WOSB certification is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.97 Tm (the same as federal [nRXCetmIWUs @ 00:02:42], and that federal WOSB is no longer self-certified. Neil McDonnell's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.75 Tm (numbers show the gap: about 95K self-certified WOSBs exist against 11-12K SBA-certified, and WOSBs won $27B) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 229.52 Tm (while less than $1B was actually set aside for them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.30 Tm (On the state and local side, the failures are procedural and they are final. D'S Construction flags the mandatory pre-bid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.07 Tm (meeting: miss it and you can't submit [yxjYYFbCa5E @ 00:02:56]. The same episode exposes the paywall trap on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 183.85 Tm (Central Bidding, where cities, parishes and school boards post for free browsing but documents and plan-holder lists sit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 168.62 Tm (behind a subscription of about $110 a month. The workaround is a paper copy from the clerk or school board) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 153.40 Tm ([yxjYYFbCa5E @ 00:01:07]. For subcontractors, that plan-holder list is the gold because it shows which GCs will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.17 Tm (receive your number. SamSearch names fragmentation as the core bottleneck of city work: every city has its own site) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 122.95 Tm (and its own process, which is the pain its aggregation and AI summaries are built to absorb [RY7zan9X3oY @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 107.72 Tm (00:02:30]. Then there is scope that bleeds margin after award. Breaking down Miami-Dade's nightly bus cleaning, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 92.50 Tm (Government Contracting Strategist & Host tells bidders to own the night shift with depot access and a 2 a.m.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 77.27 Tm (supervisor, but to price the on-call daytime piece carefully because that is where contractors get burned [iTD46ZpHbdI) Tj ET
