BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 421.55 Tm (Body: Small habits the speakers use to protect compliance and keep their edge through the Q&A and amendment cycle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 406.32 Tm (Items: Questions are taken in writing only and the answers are published in an addendum to every bidder, so never) Tj ET
