BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 277.52 Tm (Section 3: Where Practitioners Disagree & Alternative Playbooks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.30 Tm (Every shop builds a compliance matrix, but they split on the tool used to build it. Keli Krueger-Huhra of CHCEDC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.07 Tm (builds it as a spreadsheet straight out of FAR 52.212-1, logging checks such as 10-point font and a 10-page maximum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 224.85 Tm (row by row [46vBsddH6zQ @ 00:23:38]. Shannon Lindauer of THE FEDERAL PROPOSAL EXPERTS rejects Excel) Tj ET
