BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 194.40 Tm (to levels three and four and embed evaluation adjectives like "demonstrated approach" in the headings [zeJUuxLmj6s) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.17 Tm (@ 00:02:40]. Bid and Comply runs a stricter row discipline: one requirement per row, a reference number on each, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 163.95 Tm (client's exact words, and a mandatory-versus-scored flag. When the client supplies its own compliance form, they fill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 148.72 Tm (that form and keep their matrix internal [c73xWsLDDhc @ 00:03:47]. Government Contract Blueprint also keeps the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.50 Tm (matrix internal unless the solicitation demands submission. It adds an evaluation-factor column that links every Section) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 118.27 Tm (L instruction to its Section M score [jSDqXlz5MbI @ 00:00:26]. The format is a preference. What none of these shops) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.05 Tm (will skip is tying each requirement to an owner, a status, and the exact place in the proposal that answers it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 87.82 Tm (The sharpest split is over how much to write. CHCEDC teaches a one-page executive summary that reads standalone,) Tj ET
