BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (Lab states flatly that subcontracting is not a downgrade, pitching a hybrid of subcontracting plus selective small primes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (in the same service and buyer type, and telling subs to document every engagement for references [3eoJWm0WffU @) Tj ET
